==Trivia==
* Each of the spells the three girls contribute have been used prior to this chapter.
** Agott is directly referencing the seal [[Olruggio]] used for the bridge of sand at the [[Staircase River]] in [[Chapter 12]].{{Ref|m|12|26-27}}
** Tetia's flowers of sand were used to appeal to the [[The Ancients of Romonon]] in [[Chapter 24]].{{Ref|m|24|14}}
** Richeh's crystal ribbons have been used consistently, starting back in [[Chapter 18]].{{Ref|m|18|18-20}}
*Playland of Sand could be considered a [[Tandem Spell]], seeing as it is essentially four spells cast to create a joint effect. However, since tandem spells appear to have to be collaborative in nature and Beldaruit cast the spell with no input from the girls, it may not be considered one.{{Ref|m|85|4}}

